{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon: Order of the Raven is a</strong> '90s FPS retro-inspired dungeon crawler that combines fast-paced action, treasure hunting, and strategic combat. As a brave adventurer, you\u2019ll descend into the depths of a treacherous dungeon, battling relentless waves of beasts and uncovering hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level of the dungeon is more perilous than the last, filled with traps, puzzles, and enemies determined to stop your progress. Armed with weapons and spells you find along the way, you\u2019ll need to master your skills and prepare for the ultimate showdown: a fierce battle with the Lich Knight who rules the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to defeat the dungeon and claim the Order of the Raven's treasure?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3457700?t=1740602133","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457700/49a61e3a54a44960c0fa79deba234dfe5400ea5a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740602133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457700/65902dd93299dd3a117e631f1312f65818af2c45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740602133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457700/65902dd93299dd3a117e631f1312f65818af2c45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740602133","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon: Order of the Raven is a</strong> '90s FPS retro-inspired dungeon crawler that combines fast-paced action, treasure hunting, and strategic combat. As a brave adventurer, you\u2019ll descend into the depths of a treacherous dungeon, battling relentless waves of beasts and uncovering hid